"kind":"say","source_node_id":"3","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423319002","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"这次要捕猎的幻灵孢菇十分凶猛，如果不是有你们，可能真要...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1423319003:1":{"key":"say:4:1423319003:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423319003","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我在书里读到过，幻灵孢菇会用孢子攻击人类，还会制造欺骗...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1423319004:1":{"key":"say:5:1423319004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423319004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"但是人们会狩猎它作为食物，这我还是第一次知道。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1423319005:1":{"key":"say:6:1423319005:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423319005","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"毕竟平民区没有那么多可以吃的东西嘛。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1423319006:1":{"key":"say:7:1423319006:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1